{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22727","headline":"初授赞善大夫早朝寄李二十助教 · 白居易","name":"初授赞善大夫早朝寄李二十助教","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病身初谒青宫日，衰貌新垂白发年。\n寂莫曹司非热地，萧条风雪是寒天。\n远坊早起常侵鼓，瘦马行迟苦费鞭。\n一种共君官职冷，不如犹得日高眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}